{"id":"b6a74bb426d5caa0","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-linear-order-theory.md","title":"Theory of Strict Linear Orders","display":"df-linear-order-theory — Theory of Strict Linear Orders","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-linear-order-theory","aliases":["17-df-linear-order-theory"],"display":"df-linear-order-theory — Theory of Strict Linear Orders","depends_on":["[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Examples 3.5.9(1) and 3.5.12(2); local strict-order axiomatization","source_pages_print":[194,198],"source_pages_djvu":[210,214],"source_verification":"source examples compared in supplied DjVu OCR; strict-order axioms checked locally","verification_date":"2026-10-13","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-linear-order-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-linear-order-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linear-order-theory — Theory of Strict Linear Orders"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"82293682c9179b16\" href=\"?note=82293682c9179b16\" title=\"17-df-dense-linear-order\">17-df-dense-linear-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Examples 3.5.9(1) and 3.5.12(2); local strict-order axiomatization"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>194</span><span>198</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>210</span><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"source examples compared in supplied DjVu OCR; strict-order axioms checked locally"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{&lt;}\">\\(L_{&lt;}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82293682c9179b16\" href=\"?note=82293682c9179b16\" title=\"17-df-dense-linear-order\">17-df-dense-linear-order</a> 中只有二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2\">\\(x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2\\)</span> 为固定语言变量。\n以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{&lt;}\">\\(L_{&lt;}\\)</span> 句子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{LO}}\">\\(T_{\\mathrm{LO}}\\)</span>；逻辑连接词沿用该节点的一阶缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{LO}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{LO}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Examples 3.5.9(1)、3.5.12(2) 中 simple order 的严格序版本；印刷 pp.194、198，DjVu 210、214。三个公理分别是非自反性、传递性和全比较性；非空性来自本库的结构约定。这里不加稠密性和无端点公理，保留有限线序模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-dense-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"82293682c9179b16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-dense-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"82293682c9179b16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_{<}$ 为 [[17-df-dense-linear-order]] 中只有二元关系符号 $<$ 的语言，$x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2$ 为固定语言变量。\n以下定义 $L_{<}$ 句子集 $T_{\\mathrm{LO}}$；逻辑连接词沿用该节点的一阶缩写。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_{<}","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2","display":false},{"tex":"L_{<}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathrm{LO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{LO}}\\coloneqq\\{&\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)<\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)<\\operatorname{lit}(x))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1820,"backlinks":[{"id":"e06453cde5ebbf0f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=L_{<}$，$T_{\\mathrm{LO}}$ 与 $T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 分别见 [[17-df-linear-order-theory]]、[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]，均采用严格序。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n量词消去见 [[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]；与模型完备化的联系见 [[17-thm-model-completion-qe]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-linear-order-theory]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-existentially-closed]]\n[[17-df-filter]]\n[[17-df-filters]]\n[[17-df-first-order-language]]\n[[17-df-formula]]\n[[17-df-formula-consequence]]\n[[17-df-fraisse-class]]\n[[17-df-free-variable]]\n[[17-df-generated-filter]]\n[[17-df-generated-substructure]]\n[[17-df-ho